OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of child sex abuse
OL,4,Adies before trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was due to stand trial over
OL,7,F39 sexual abuse allegations dating back
OL,8,Fto the early 1980s has died while
OL,9,Fremanded in custody at HMP Leeds.
OL,11,FColin Gaines, 73, from Bingley, had
OL,12,Fbeen due to face allegations relating
OL,13,Fto 10 male complainants and his trial
OL,14,Fat Bradford Crown Court was expected to
OL,15,Flast up to five weeks.
OL,17,FBut earlier, prosecutor Julian Jones
OL,18,Fconfirmed that on Wednesday the
OL,19,Fprosecution team was informed Gaines
OL,20,Fhad died after being taken ill.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
